      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have encountered this issue for a long time, from like SDK version 3.0.4 or something onwards. I can also confirm, that the one-line fix from @{5a983204a1528d415c5ced46|full_name} fixes it.\n\nAs a workaround for that issue I disabled prefab auto saving (top right of scene view while editing a prefab). It will still mark stuff as dirty as soon as you select the avatar, but at least it doesn't freak out entirely.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
