      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has neither been officialy acknowledged nor fixed yet. The underlying issue also causes a plethora of issues down the line related to Prefabs - including Unity Editor crashes on specific package imports and asset database corruption.\n\nRolling back to 3.1.10 solves this issue - broken projects might need a rebuild/reimport of the asset database by deleting the Library, Temp and other transient project directories",
